         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Images from Cahal Pech\n\nThese images are copyright for Cahal Pech and allowed to be used according to the license determined by them.\n\nTo visualize all images, use the left and right arrows on the slide below.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><div class=\"htSlides\"><div class=\"htSlide\"><div class=\"htSlideCounter\">1 / 3</div><img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"imgCPE\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgCPE', '0%')\"><div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Photo taken at the archaeological site of Cahal Pech, Belize, on <htdate0>, during a visit to the site (<htcite0>).</div><div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b><ul><li>Physics: Always present - many times we are so focused on ourselves or on opposites that we do not notice what is always present. (<htcite1>)</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"htSlide\"><div class=\"htSlideCounter\">2 / 3</div><img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"imgCahalPech0\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgCahalPech0', '0%')\"><div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Pyramid at the archaeological site of Cahal Pech, Belize (<htcite2>).</div><div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b><ul><li>Translation game (Part I) - Explore numbers from different cultures through an engaging translation game. (<htcite3>)</li><li>The result is - a game of consecutive sums that helps uncover the story. (<htcite4>)</li><li>The result is (Phase II) - a game to reinforce the connection between addition and multiplication. (<htcite5>)</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"htSlide\"><div class=\"htSlideCounter\">3 / 3</div><img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"img1\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('img1', '0%')\"><div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Mesoamerican Chocolate Pot. Photo taken on <htdate1>, during a visit to the archaeological site of Cahal Pech, Belize (<htcite6>).</div><div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b><ul><li>Natural limits - In this text, we explore various natural limits and explain how mathematics is used to describe them. (<htcite7>)</li><li>There is something else - In this text, we return to the kitchen to check how much is left of the ingredients from a recipe. (<htcite8>)</li></ul></div></div><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-left htSlidePrev\" onclick=\"htPlusDivs(-1);\"></i><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right htSlideNext\" onclick=\"htPlusDivs(1);\"></i></div></p>",
